WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.585 --> 00:00:02.481
- Today, someone said
nice meeting you, Jim.

00:00:02.481 --> 00:00:04.358
There are much worse things to be known as

00:00:04.358 --> 00:00:07.691
than Jim Halpert from the Office, boosh.

00:00:13.155 --> 00:00:14.651
That's kind of one of these.

00:00:14.651 --> 00:00:16.720
When I first got the
Office, my friends and I

00:00:16.720 --> 00:00:18.901
went to a bar, we're
talking like season one,

00:00:18.901 --> 00:00:21.283
and my friends, we
couldn't get in the bar,

00:00:21.283 --> 00:00:22.937
and my friends just said, just go up

00:00:22.937 --> 00:00:24.811
and say you're from the
Office, and I said okay,

00:00:24.811 --> 00:00:26.542
so I went up to this bouncer and I said,

00:00:26.542 --> 00:00:30.736
I'm, I'm an actor, I'm
the guy on the Office.

00:00:30.736 --> 00:00:32.819
And he goes I don't care.

00:00:35.299 --> 00:00:36.450
I don't think I can successfully

00:00:36.450 --> 00:00:39.859
really incorporate all
that is Chris Pratt.

00:00:39.859 --> 00:00:42.776
There's a whole lot of charm there.

00:00:45.478 --> 00:00:48.018
Any kids movie, definitely the Lion King,

00:00:48.018 --> 00:00:51.768
Frozen, cried in that,
at Olaf of all people.

00:00:55.023 --> 00:00:57.756
I'm 92 years old, I don't even
know how to turn on my phone.

00:00:57.756 --> 00:00:59.486
That's not true, I do know
how to turn on my phone,

00:00:59.486 --> 00:01:02.178
but I don't know how
to do email or Twitter.

00:01:02.178 --> 00:01:03.765
Does that mean that
you get to like wrestle

00:01:03.765 --> 00:01:06.515
an actual creature to the ground?

00:01:08.008 --> 00:01:09.501
I've had a great experience with Uber,

00:01:09.501 --> 00:01:11.477
but there have been one or two times

00:01:11.477 --> 00:01:13.127
where I feel like I'm in Speed Racer,

00:01:13.127 --> 00:01:15.877
which is exciting and terrifying.

00:01:18.390 --> 00:01:19.727
No, I don't think I've watched

00:01:19.727 --> 00:01:21.720
any episodes since the show wrapped.

00:01:21.720 --> 00:01:24.192
We always used to get together
to watch the episodes,

00:01:24.192 --> 00:01:26.545
so there's nothing that
fun as getting together

00:01:26.545 --> 00:01:28.866
with your whole cast, and like having

00:01:28.866 --> 00:01:31.591
your arms around each other,
eating a couple cheese plates.

00:01:31.591 --> 00:01:34.591
I don't know if I can recreate that.

00:01:37.112 --> 00:01:39.435
Yeah, as an adult, you're like
chicken nuggets and fries,

00:01:39.435 --> 00:01:41.105
I mean I'm not going to eat like a whole

00:01:41.105 --> 00:01:44.830
bland colored meal, and then
you order for your daughter,

00:01:44.830 --> 00:01:46.225
and I've had my daughter say like

00:01:46.225 --> 00:01:48.646
I don't want chicken nuggets,
and the waitress will come by,

00:01:48.646 --> 00:01:50.930
and I'll be like, she
loves chicken nuggets,

00:01:50.930 --> 00:01:54.347
and then they're gone because I eat them.

